    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2Ji1uARozVKQj5uPwiyseCb)_\n\n- Adds a \"Commit and PR messages start with an emoji\" section to the global `README.org`.\n- Adds ADR 0026 (and its row in `adr/README.org`) with the reasons.\n- Adds a root `CLAUDE.md` so Claude follows the rule in future PRs and commits.\n- Standard: ✨ feature, 🐛 bug fix, 🔧 tooling, 📝 docs; ⚡ performance and 🔥 removal kept because they were already in use.\n- All 289 existing PR titles without an emoji were retitled on GitHub (no code change).\n- Old commits on `main` are not rewritten (needs a force-push).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9FUEU5Mdtq7at7Z7y)_",
